  "details": "You have 2 instances in the same world but each is half empty? Then merging them may be better than convincing everyone to use a portal\n\nWhy?\n\nLet's say that your instance is going good but then you need to leave, one of your friends is hosting a group public and maybe you want everyone to go to their instance but no one listens, then you could merge the instance with your friend's instance\n\nOption 1\n\nWith this option all the people remain in the same location they were before and they magically appear in the new instance (may break all but it is seamless)\n\nOption 2\n\nEveryone gets automatically sent to the new instance, they may have an option to choose wether to click on their menu and join the merged instance or remain in the closed instance, because the instance closes when the merge starts\n\nOption 3\n\nThe instance closes, there is a 2 minutes countdown and then the instance merges with the other and everyone joins the instance it has been merged with",
